{"overview":"کیئو ۳، هینوموتو، ای‌تو. در حالی که دورهٔ باکوماتسو ژاپن را به آشوب می‌کشاند، کوو باشین جوان آرزو دارد با استفاده از Standard Battle Spirits قوی‌تر شود. جهان او وقتی با آجارا زتسو، سامورایی سرگردان و مبارز ابدی قدرتمند که توسط نیروهای ضد شوجون تعقیب می‌شود، مواجه می‌شود، تغییر می‌کند. همان‌طور که دنیای Standard و Eternal Battle به هم می‌پیوندند، کوو به سفر زتسو کشیده می‌شود و تاریخ را به حرکت در می‌آورد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Keio 3, Hinomoto, Eito. As the Bakumatsu throws Japan into turmoil, young Kuu Bashin dreams of becoming stronger through Standard Battle Spirits. His world changes when he encounters Ajara Zetsu, a wandering samurai and formidable Eternal Battler pursued by anti-shogunate forces. As the worlds of Standard and Eternal Battle collide, Kuu is pulled into Zetsu's journey—and sets history in motion.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2026,"poster":"/4ScTaJZ4g4ZPQmfxRHe6AyK5S48.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"草野太一","role":"Kuu Bashin (voice)","photo":"/n66nZUsRMEhqrkwUqGbgJKgE7TS.jpg","en":"Taichi Kusano"},{"name":"濱野大輝","role":"Ajara Zetsu (voice)","photo":"/bykeH3Rhmx9PPFegYNi6s310cNa.jpg","en":"Daiki Hamano"},{"name":"下野紘","role":"Ibuki Mizuha (voice)","photo":"/yrSDcgFefHtWkFmLnTrcw2t0MV.jpg","en":"Hiro Shimono"},{"name":"伊瀬茉莉也","role":"Yui Kusumoto (voice)","photo":"/uMHWTKGolzzjXCiv20F0n8h2Pqu.jpg","en":"Mariya Ise"},{"name":"間宮康弘","role":"Suiboku Bashin (voice)","photo":"/pvnOU0RZuMKeISDTBEU7uSt3Xkn.jpg","en":"Yasuhiro Mamiya"},{"name":"水樹奈々","role":"Mine Kusumoto (voice)","photo":"/rQBo7HyjTIqeB7hIofb7uJFhiVs.jpg","en":"Nana Mizuki"},{"name":"梅澤めぐ","role":"Shie Anpachi (voice)","photo":"/wsBkrHKVSNv6u2fkZ9qau56BsRC.jpg","en":"Megu Umezawa"},{"name":"石田彰","role":"Jinzan Takasugi (voice)","photo":"/jnW2Gn2NlR2uwOCeyOuzypnTmkH.jpg","en":"Akira Ishida"},{"name":"دایسوکه اونو","role":"Ryoga Sakamoto (voice)","ph